mi wo sumashiteComment: 0,0:01:07.41,0:01:10.85,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,Sagashi dasou kimi no kotae woComment: 0,0:01:10.85,0:01:14.05,Karaoke Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,Michi wa kanarazu tsuzuiteiru yoComment: 0,0:01:14.05,0:01:16.59,Karaoke Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,Mada mitakoto no nai umi heComment: 0,0:01:15.68,0:01:16.59,Karaoke - Copy - Copy,,0,0,0,karaoke,umi heComment: 0,0:01:16.59,0:01:17.86,Karaoke,,0,0,0,karaoke,We are hopeComment: 0,0:01:17.86,0:01:21.23,Karaoke Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,Aoku hiroi sekai no hate niComment: 0,0:01:21.23,0:01:23.73,Karaoke Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,Kimi to kaeru beki basho ga aruComment: 0,0:01:23.73,0:01:26.53,Karaoke Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,Boku tachi wa eien niComment: 0,0:01:26.53,0:01:33.27,Karaoke Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,Tooi mukashi sou kimeteitaComment: 0,0:01:43.92,0:01:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Comment: 0,0:00:02.01,0:00:05.65,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,君｜き#｜みへの想｜お#｜もいが高｜た#｜か鳴｜!なってComment: 0,0:00:05.65,0:00:09.15,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,限｜か#｜ぎりなきチカラ生｜うまれるComment: 0,0:00:09.15,0:00:12.36,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,求｜も#｜とめるならば　どこまでもComment: 0,0:00:12.36,0:00:14.93,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,変｜かわらぬキズナ振｜ふりかざそうComment: 0,0:00:22.37,0:00:29.24,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,君｜き#｜みと本｜ほん気｜！きで心｜＜こ#｜こ#｜ろぶつけ슴｜あった喜｜＜よ#｜ろ#｜こびもComment: 0,0:00:29.24,0:00:36.55,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,笑｜わ#｜らい転｜こ#｜ろげてナミダ乾｜か#｜わかした切｜せ#｜つなさもComment: 0,0:00:36.55,0:00:43.39,Kanji Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,繋｜つ#｜なぎあわせて風｜か#｜ぜの中｜な#｜か　あぁComment: 0,0:00:43.39,0:00:50.16,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,はためいているよ　高｜た#｜かく　高｜た#｜かくComment: 0,0:00:50.16,0:00:53.33,Kanji Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,Why　探｜さ#｜がすことを諦｜＜あ#｜き#｜らめたのComment: 0,0:00:53.33,0:00:56.74,Kanji Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,Why　独｜ひ#｜とり闘｜＜た#｜た#｜かい続｜つ#｜づけるのComment: 0,0:00:56.74,0:00:59.64,Kanji Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,ねえ　どんな未｜み来｜！ら#｜い　覚｜か#｜く悟｜！ごしたのComment: 0,0:00:59.64,0:01:03.34,Kanji Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,夢｜ゆ#｜めはもう手｜てにしたのComment: 0,0:01:03.54,0:01:07.41,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,目｜めを閉｜とじて耳｜み#｜みを澄｜すましてComment: 0,0:01:07.41,0:01:10.85,Kanji,,0,0,0,karaoke,探｜さ#｜がし出｜だそう　君｜き#｜みの答｜こ#｜たえをComment: 0,0:01:10.85,0:01:14.05,Kanji Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,道｜み#｜ちは必｜＜か#｜な#｜らず　続｜つ#｜づいているよComment: 0,0:01:14.05,0:01:16.59,Kanji Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,まだ見｜みたことのない海｜う#｜みへComment: 0,0:01:15.68,0:01:16.59,Kanji - Copy - Copy,,0,0,0,karaoke,海｜う#｜みへComment: 0,0:01:17.86,0:01:21.23,Kanji Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,青｜あ#｜おく広｜ひ#｜ろい世｜せ界｜！か#｜いの果｜はてにComment: 0,0:01:21.23,0:01:23.73,Kanji Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,君｜き#｜みと還｜か#｜えるべき場｜ば所｜！しょがあるComment: 0,0:01:23.73,0:01:26.53,Kanji Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,僕｜ぼ#｜くたちは永｜え#｜い遠｜！えんにComment: 0,0:01:26.53,0:01:33.27,Kanji Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,遠｜とおい昔｜＜む#｜か#｜し　そう決｜きめていたComment: 0,0:02:16.92,0:02:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Comment: 0,0:00:02.01,0:00:05.65,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,My heart throbs at the thought of youComment: 0,0:00:05.65,0:00:09.15,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Limitless power surgesComment: 0,0:00:09.15,0:00:12.36,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,As long as you wish,Comment: 0,0:00:12.36,0:00:14.93,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,We'll brandish our unchanging bondComment: 0,0:00:22.37,0:00:29.24,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,The joy of letting our true feelings fly at each otherComment: 0,0:00:29.24,0:00:36.55,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,The pain from how we laughed our heads off to dry our tearsComment: 0,0:00:36.55,0:00:43.39,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,We connect them together and in the wind AhComment: 0,0:00:43.39,0:00:50.16,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,It's fluttering higher and higherComment: 0,0:00:50.16,0:00:53.33,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,Why did you give up on your search?Comment: 0,0:00:53.33,0:00:56.74,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,Why do you keep fighting by yourself?Comment: 0,0:00:56.74,0:00:59.64,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,Say, what kind of future did you prepare for?Comment: 0,0:00:59.64,0:01:03.34,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,Have you fulfilled your dream?Comment: 0,0:01:03.54,0:01:07.41,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Close your eyes and listen carefullyComment: 0,0:01:07.41,0:01:10.85,Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Let's look for your answerComment: 0,0:01:10.85,0:01:14.05,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,The road always continues towards the seaComment: 0,0:01:14.05,0:01:16.59,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,That you've never seenComment: 0,0:01:17.86,0:01:21.23,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,At the broad, blue end of the worldComment: 0,0:01:21.23,0:01:23.73,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,There is a place I have to return to with youComment: 0,0:01:23.73,0:01:26.53,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,We will be foreverComment: 0,0:01:26.53,0:01:33.27,Translation Gray,,0,0,0,karaoke,decided long ago in the pastDialogue: 0,0:01:34.31,0:01:36.65,Title,,0,0,0,,A Woman's HonorDialogue: 0,0:01:37.72,0:01:40.67,Main,,0,0,0,,We managed to make it to the sea.Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.73,0:01:48.87,Main,,0,0,0,,All we have to do now is get to the Sunny.Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.73,0:01:48.87,Captions,,0,1000,265,,Juice River, Sweet CityDialogue: 0,0:01:51.26,0:01:55.09,Main,,0,0,0,,It's so sweet, I'm really happy!Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.09,0:01:58.26,Main,,0,0,0,,What? I don't like it. It's sticky all over...Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.22,0:02:01.83,Main,,0,0,0,,See? The helm is slippery...Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.83,0:02:06.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Watch out! Move out of my way, fish-san!Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.27,0:02:12.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Brook! Isn't that a mermaid?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.27,0:02:14.79,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! A mermaid-san?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.79,0:02:16.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's a merman!Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.88,0:02:18.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh...Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.49,0:02:23.58,Main,,0,0,0,,What is he doing? Fishing, maybe?Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.39,0:02:27.62,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't care anymore...Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.40,0:02:37.44,Captions,,0,0,0,,Southwestern Coast The Seducing WoodsDialogue: 0,0:02:37.44,0:02:42.12,Main,,0,0,0,,As long as Big Mom is going through her Hunger Pangs, all we can do is run!Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.12,0:02:44.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Hunger Pangs? What're those?Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.40,0:02:47.48,Main,,0,0,0,,She's having a tantrum!Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.89,0:02:53.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Until she can eat what she craves...Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.76,0:02:58.32,Main,,0,0,0,,she'll keep rampaging without discretion!Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.39,0:03:02.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Wedding...Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.17,0:03:06.05,Main,,0,0,0,,cake!!Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.90,0:03:10.52,Main,,0,0,0,,She's almost unconscious...Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.77,0:03:15.78,Main,,0,0,0,,What she craves this time seems to be a wedding cake!Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.88,0:03:26.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Maybe because she didn't get to eat the cake at the wedding!Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.00,0:03:28.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy! You shouldn't have ruined the cake!Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.68,0:03:35.01,Main,,0,0,0,,But the plan succeeded!Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.01,0:03:38.26,Main,,0,0,0,,And I've never gotten to eat such a delicious cake before!Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.72,0:03:45.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Were you eating during the mission?!Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.87,0:03:53.77,Main,,0,0,0,,I ate it too! It was delicious!Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.77,0:03:58.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Anyway, hurry up! I'm sure we're close to the Sunny!Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.32,0:04:04.49,Main,,0,0,0,,It's really hard to tell if we're going straight through these woods!Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.68,0:04:24.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Is this really the right way?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.18,0:04:26.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh! Look!Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.44,0:04:30.02,Main,,0,0,0,,That river looks familiar!Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.60,0:04:34.82,Main,,0,0,0,,The Sunny must be right across the river!Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.73,0:04:37.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute!Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.70,0:04:45.87,Main,,0,0,0,,If I'm remembering right, that bridge was broken before!Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.87,0:04:47.17,Main,,0,0,0,,You're right...Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.17,0:04:50.79,Main,,0,0,0,,If these woods are our enemy, we can't trust anything!Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.79,0:04:55.29,Main,,0,0,0,,They're trying to fool us...Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.02,0:05:02.18,Main,,0,0,0,,So I'm sure they're shifting the landscape to confuse us...Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.18,0:05:04.01,Main,,0,0,0,,In other words...Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.01,0:05:07.31,Main,,0,0,0,,this isn't the place we think it is!Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.19,0:05:11.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Lola's Vivre Card won't help us anymore...Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.51,0:05:14.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, since Mama herself is right behind us!Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.77,0:05:18.28,Main,,0,0,0,,That gives you all the more reason to keep feeding him, Nami.Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.28,0:05:20.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah... Zeus!Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.11,0:05:29.61,Main,,0,0,0,,It's...Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.61,0:05:32.04,Main,,0,0,0,,It's delicious! So delicious!Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.04,0:05:37.37,Main,,0,0,0,,If we let Zeus go back to Mama, there's no way we'll be able to escape.Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.27,0:05:45.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Come back, Zeus!Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.24,0:05:53.04,Main,,0,0,0,,If we're too slow, she'll catch up!Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.04,0:05:56.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! I'm gonna get scolded!Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.09,0:05:57.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.46,0:05:58.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Prometheus!Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.68,0:06:03.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Why are you disobeying Mama's orders, Zeus?!Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.35,0:06:05.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Zeus! Look at me!Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.01,0:06:13.06,Main,,0,0,0,,I've got an exquisite Weather Egg filled with juicy thunderclouds!Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.06,0:06:14.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Wow! That looks great!Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.85,0:06:17.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Whoa, wait, Zeus!Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.11,0:06:22.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sun!Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.03,0:06:26.53,Main,,0,0,0,,How dare you...Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.29,0:06:30.45,Main,,0,0,0,,burn up the tree guy!Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.45,0:06:33.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Rubber-Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.10,0:06:36.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Hawk Gatling!Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.24,0:06:40.97,Main,,0,0,0,,That's our Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.44,0:06:53.86,Main,,0,0,0,,What the?!Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.86,0:06:55.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't think...Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.26,0:07:00.78,Main,,0,0,0,,that you can beat me with just that!Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.79,0:07:02.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh! Ow, ow, ow!Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.66,0:07:06.71,Main,,0,0,0,,If Armament Haki doesn't work, he'll be harder to deal with than a Logia!Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.71,0:07:09.25,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna burn you all to death!Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.25,0:07:12.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Ow, ow! It's hot! Ouch, ouch, ouch!Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.35,0:07:19.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Come back, Zeus!Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.74,0:07:23.17,Main,,0,0,0,,I will! I will, but...Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.39,0:07:27.16,Main,,0,0,0,,I wanna eat just one more juicy thundercloud!Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.16,0:07:28.27,Main,,0,0,0,,You...Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.48,0:07:32.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Jinbe!Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.47,0:07:35.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Cross the bridge now, everyone!Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.67,0:07:36.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.50,0:07:38.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Spear Wave!Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.16,0:07:40.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Rain Shower!Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.83,0:07:44.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Did it work?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.05,0:07:45.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course!Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.33,0:07:48.36,Main,,0,0,0,,He's just a mass of compressed flames!Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.36,0:07:50.96,Main,,0,0,0,,He's nothing but a big, talking flame.Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.09,0:07:55.09,Main,,0,0,0,,You bastard...Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.77,0:08:01.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Are they...?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.18,0:08:02.97,Captions,,0,0,0,,MobileDialogue: 0,0:08:02.72,0:08:04.47,Captions,,0,0,0,,KatoDialogue: 0,0:08:04.22,0:08:06.73,Captions,,0,0,0,,CompoDialogue: 0,0:08:03.96,0:08:06.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Get ready, Straw Hat Crew!Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.48,0:08:08.48,Captions,,0,0,0,,LaurinDialogue: 0,0:08:06.48,0:08:08.23,Main,,0,0,0,,This Seducing Woods will be...Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.23,0:08:10.73,Captions,,0,0,0,,TabletDialogue: 0,0:08:08.23,0:08:10.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Where you die!Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.48,0:08:12.19,Captions,,0,0,0,,High-FatDialogue: 0,0:08:10.48,0:08:12.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Drop dead!Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.19,0:08:14.40,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! I can't believe they caught up to us!Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.40,0:08:17.45,Main,,0,0,0,,The Homies must've shifted the landscape!Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.74,0:08:31.28,Main,,0,0,0,,They're closing in from both sides...Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.28,0:08:34.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Then we only have one option...Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.18,0:08:37.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's kick their asses!Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.29,0:08:55.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Your name's Pedro, right? I saw you five years ago, too...Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.51,0:09:05.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Oopsy!Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.86,0:09:19.73,Main,,0,0,0,,You silly rabbit!Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.83,0:09:25.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Garchu!Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.42,0:09:28.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop!Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.79,0:09:34.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes!Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.62,0:09:36.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Brother Tablet!Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.33,0:09:38.56,Main,,0,0,0,,You'd better pay attention!Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.88,0:09:46.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Diable Jambe!Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.47,0:09:55.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Flambage Shot!Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.70,0:10:07.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Rubber-Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.42,0:10:15.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Eagle Bazooka!Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.46,0:10:25.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't get separated!Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.89,0:10:28.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Or we'll never see each other again!Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.14,0:10:28.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.52,0:10:31.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.00,0:10:31.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.67,0:10:33.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy, stop Carrot!Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.73,0:10:34.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.54,0:10:48.16,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't let you get away!Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.33,0:10:50.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Duck!Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.06,0:11:07.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Take this!Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.07,0:11:08.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Watch out!Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.11,0:11:12.47,Main,,0,0,0,,You...!Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.05,0:11:26.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Cake!Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.22,0:11:30.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Is this it?Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.88,0:11:32.64,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll eat that!Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.64,0:11:33.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Zeus!Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.72,0:11:36.27,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a delicious cloud!Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.11,0:11:40.12,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.12,0:11:41.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Is that...Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.66,0:11:43.54,Main,,0,0,0,,What is it?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.37,0:11:48.71,Main,,0,0,0,,So delicious!Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.64,0:11:58.18,Main,,0,0,0,,My Weather Egg is inside of Zeus...!Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.18,0:12:02.01,Main,,0,0,0,,What is he doing?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.01,0:12:03.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Zeus!Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.13,0:12:12.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys!Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.41,0:12:15.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry we kept you waiting!Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.01,0:12:31.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Why are they...Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.72,0:12:34.72,Main,,0,0,0,,on the Sunny?Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.72,0:12:40.43,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. Your friends aren't here. Lick!Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.07,0:12:51.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Zeus Breeze...Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.87,0:12:56.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Tempo!Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.88,0:13:28.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me Luffy and the others are...Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.33,0:13:34.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Is that...Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.08,0:13:40.29,Main,,0,0,0,,It looks like Mama finished them off with Zeus. Mama'll be here soon.Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.29,0:13:41.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Lick!Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.68,0:13:45.53,Main,,0,0,0,,He's saying that, but they'll be fine, right?Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.53,0:13:47.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm sure they will!Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.73,0:13:53.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Lick! I guess your friends are dead...Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.62,0:13:57.04,Main,,0,0,0,,So what are you two gonna do?Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.04,0:14:00.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Even if you risk your life and try to take back this ship...Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.28,0:14:02.76,Main,,0,0,0,,none of your friends will return.Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.82,0:14:12.52,Main,,0,0,0,,If you want to escape from here in that submarine, I don't mind letting just the two of you leave.Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.74,0:14:21.46,Main,,0,0,0,,No, thanks.Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.34,0:14:27.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Kung Fu Point!Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.92,0:14:32.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Get off of the ship, you bastards! The Sunny is ours!Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.32,0:14:37.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you want to fight?Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.10,0:14:38.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course!Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.30,0:14:43.76,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll save the Sunny!Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.76,0:14:47.60,Main,,0,0,0,,I guess you want to die. Lick!Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.59,0:15:03.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's get started! A fully-standing show!Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.24,0:15:04.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.96,0:15:10.64,Main,,0,0,0,,The forest is... What happened?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.64,0:15:12.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Is everyone okay?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.29,0:15:14.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Rabiyan, go faster!Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.09,0:15:15.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.38,0:15:22.68,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I asked you to help, Sister...Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.68,0:15:27.43,Main,,0,0,0,,It's okay! It's been a long time since we made a cake together!Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.23,0:15:30.75,Main,,0,0,0,,On top of that...Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.11,0:15:37.46,Main,,0,0,0,,You're going?! Are you kidding?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.46,0:15:43.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Bege! Didn't I tell you?! The Straw Hats saved my younger sister Lola's life!Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.66,0:15:47.00,Main,,0,0,0,,But, Chiffon, it's dangerous! I'm worried!Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.00,0:15:50.48,Main,,0,0,0,,He's right-rero! You must escape with us-rero!Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.48,0:15:52.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry. That was too loud...Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.54,0:15:55.42,Main,,0,0,0,,We can't leave without you, Ma'am!Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.42,0:15:56.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Come back, Chiffon!Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.92,0:16:00.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Dangerous?! Yes, I know that!Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.43,0:16:08.67,Main,,0,0,0,,"Thank you for saving Lola." It's too easy to just say that.Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.67,0:16:13.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Sincerity will be proven when you help the ones you're indebted to!Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.32,0:16:16.57,Main,,0,0,0,,You're right, but...Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.57,0:16:22.28,Main,,0,0,0,,That's how you do your duty, right, darling?Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.25,0:16:26.33,Main,,0,0,0,,If something happens to me...Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.33,0:16:31.56,Main,,0,0,0,,please take care of...Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.56,0:16:32.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Pez for me!Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.21,0:16:41.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Chiffon!Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.76,0:16:44.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Ma'am!Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.52,0:16:55.15,Main,,0,0,0,,I have to save Nami and the others, and return to my family!Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.15,0:16:57.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Sister! There he is!Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.57,0:17:01.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Pudding? Were you listening?Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.49,0:17:03.95,Main,,0,0,0,,S... Sanji-san is...Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.12,0:17:07.73,Main,,0,0,0,,S... S...Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.08,0:17:09.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji...Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.42,0:17:16.11,Main,,0,0,0,,S...Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.11,0:17:17.42,Main,,0,0,0,,S...Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.80,0:17:19.34,Main,,0,0,0,,S...Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.97,0:17:22.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji's there! That fool!Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.09,0:17:23.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Say what?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.83,0:17:30.71,Main,,0,0,0,,That was pretty powerful!Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.71,0:17:34.34,Main,,0,0,0,,My Clima-Tact isn't able to generate lightning like that!Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.34,0:17:36.20,Main,,0,0,0,,With that much power...Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.78,0:17:41.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Where's Big Mom?Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.40,0:17:42.80,Main,,0,0,0,,She must've been hit directly!Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.80,0:17:45.71,Main,,0,0,0,,She's probably in that giant hole!Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.71,0:17:49.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Did we just take down Big Mom?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.87,0:17:59.69,Main,,0,0,0,,What is it?Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.89,0:18:10.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Wedding...!Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.59,0:18:12.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Mom's voice?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.13,0:18:14.18,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought so...Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.18,0:18:16.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Cake!Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.57,0:18:18.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Is she alive?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.32,0:18:25.35,Main,,0,0,0,,She's not someone we can beat that easily...Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.56,0:18:28.86,Main,,0,0,0,,She's climbing up!Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.28,0:18:37.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Is the hole too deep for her to climb out?Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.16,0:18:39.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's run while she's in there!Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.25,0:18:42.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah. While Big Mom can't move!Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.43,0:18:48.50,Main,,0,0,0,,No, she's already on her way...Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.75,0:18:51.60,Main,,0,0,0,,The ground is...Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.60,0:18:52.80,Main,,0,0,0,,No way!Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.62,0:19:07.31,Main,,0,0,0,,There's no stopping Big Mom when she's having a Hunger Pang attack!Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.31,0:19:10.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Wedding...Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.60,0:19:13.57,Main,,0,0,0,,cake!Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.19,0:19:16.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh no! Run!Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.71,0:19:21.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Wedding...Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.08,0:19:23.70,Main,,0,0,0,,No... The ground's gonna crack open!Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.89,0:19:27.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Here she comes!Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.88,0:19:34.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Run!Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.40,0:19:38.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Cake!Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.70,0:19:42.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Bring it to me!Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.24,0:19:48.33,Main,,0,0,0,,I know you guys have it!Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.95,0:19:53.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.83,0:19:56.34,Main,,0,0,0,,She's at the top!Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.42,0:20:00.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Crew!Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.98,0:20:01.60,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.60,0:20:03.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Pudding! Chiffon!Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.01,0:20:06.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, Pudding! What's wrong with you?! You fooled us!Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.97,0:20:09.31,Main,,0,0,0,,To stop Mama's Hunger Pang attack...Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.31,0:20:12.98,Main,,0,0,0,,See? We should've tied her up earlier!Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.98,0:20:14.60,Main,,0,0,0,,To stop Mama's...Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.60,0:20:18.86,Main,,0,0,0,,But why's Chiffon with her?! I thought she ran away with Bege's group!Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.86,0:20:19.70,Main,,0,0,0,,To stop Mama's...Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.70,0:20:20.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Wanna fight?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.44,0:20:23.15,Main,,0,0,0,,No, I don't! Listen to me!Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.15,0:20:25.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Pudding-chan, you're okay!Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.49,0:20:30.33,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm glad that your pretty face isn't hurt!Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.33,0:20:32.68,Main,,0,0,0,,So lovely! So lovely!Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.68,0:20:33.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Pudding, get it together!Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.80,0:20:40.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Mama's coming!Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.59,0:20:41.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama!Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.80,0:20:45.10,Main,,0,0,0,,We have no time! Pudding, get right to the point!Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.10,0:20:46.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.75,0:20:50.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Pathetic! You fools! You're not gonna make it!Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.94,0:20:53.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Even if you escape by ship,Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.80,0:20:59.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama will chase you to the farthest sea and sink you to the ocean floor!Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.87,0:21:02.70,Main,,0,0,0,,What did you say, you bastard?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.95,0:21:07.43,Main,,0,0,0,,That's not right, Pudding! What are you talking about?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.43,0:21:10.96,Main,,0,0,0,,You're right! You're right! What am I saying?!Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.96,0:21:12.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Listen!Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.20,0:21:18.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama believes that you guys stole the wedding cake she really wanted to eat!Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.57,0:21:22.06,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! We don't have a cake!Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.06,0:21:29.06,Main,,0,0,0,,I know! But right now, Mama's in a state where she'll chase you across the water to get that cake!Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.06,0:21:32.60,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right! So, Sanji! Come here!Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.60,0:21:38.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Watch as your friends get killed by Mama and go through hell!Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.66,0:21:45.16,Main,,0,0,0,,That's not right!Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.16,0:21:49.21,Main,,0,0,0,,– What are you talking about?! – You're right! I wanna disappear!Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.21,0:21:52.59,Main,,0,0,0,,If that's what you came to say, go away, you fools!Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.59,0:21:54.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute! That wasn't it!Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.84,0:21:56.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Black Leg Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.44,0:21:57.36,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.36,0:22:01.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Pudding told me you're good at making sweets, too!Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.09,0:22:04.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm an excellent chef.Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.96,0:22:08.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay! Then, help us bake the cake!Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.38,0:22:11.80,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll make a cake that's capable of stopping Mama.Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.80,0:22:14.23,Main,,0,0,0,,And then we'll help you guys escape!Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.23,0:22:16.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Chiffon! Why?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.15,0:22:21.57,Main,,0,0,0,,I wanna repay you for saving Lola! And I'll risk my life to do it!Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.57,0:22:23.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Chiffon!Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.62,0:22:24.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh!Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.45,0:22:30.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Hmph! Maybe that's the end result! But unlike my sister, I'm not doing it for you!Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.54,0:22:35.48,Main,,0,0,0,,The cake that I was planning to bake for myself happened to be the one Mama is craving now!Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.48,0:22:40.09,Main,,0,0,0,,A-A-And I just happened to be in this area! I didn't know you guys were here!Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.51,0:22:49.52,Main,,0,0,0,,S-So it's not like I came all the way to stop her because I didn't want you to die, Sanji...Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.18,0:22:51.64,Main,,0,0,0,,-san!Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.75,0:22:58.44,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Her emotions are like a roller coaster!Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.44,0:23:00.80,Main,,0,0,0,,I see! That's good!Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.80,0:23:02.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Where can we bake the cake?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.70,0:23:05.88,Main,,0,0,0,,We have extra ingredients at Chocolat Town!Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.88,0:23:12.32,Main,,0,0,0,,First we'll go to Chocolat Town and bake the cake as fast as we can!Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.32,0:23:16.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Then we'll carry it on a ship and deliver it to you!Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.52,0:23:20.40,Main,,0,0,0,,And we'll let Mama, who will be chasing you, eat the cake!Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.94,0:23:26.61,Main,,0,0,0,,That way, we can distract her attention away from you! So just hang in there until then!Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.32,0:23:28.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Is she coming?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.89,0:23:31.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Wedding...Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.62,0:23:35.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Once you sail out to sea, you'll have enemies in front of you, too!Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.10,0:23:38.29,Main,,0,0,0,,But I believe you guys can handle it!Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.29,0:23:39.25,Main,,0,0,0,,We will!Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.25,0:23:41.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Then... I'll come with you!Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.06,0:23:41.60,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.60,0:23:43.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, hurry up and hop on!Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.30,0:23:47.98,Main,,0,0,0,,W-W-Wait! Who said you could ride with us, idiot?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.98,0:23:50.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Cake!Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.34,0:23:59.76,Main,,0,0,0,,She got up!Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.14,0:24:07.56,Main,,0,0,0,,The cake you guys are baking is the only way to stop Big Mom!Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.56,0:24:09.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh!Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.15,0:24:10.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Guys!Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.63,0:24:14.24,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna leave you for now, but I promise I'll return!Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.24,0:24:15.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh!Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.99,0:24:17.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.08,0:24:23.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know you will!Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.06,0:24:32.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.45,0:24:33.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Pudding!Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.66,0:24:35.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Chiffon!Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.43,0:24:40.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh no! She's gonna do it again!Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.81,0:24:44.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Get away!Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.02,0:24:51.61,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?!Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.61,0:24:54.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy! I'll see you at sea!Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.11,0:24:56.07,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you, Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.48,0:25:01.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Nation's Might!Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.34,0:25:47.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Enough already...Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.50,0:25:49.38,Main,,0,0,0,,That was close.Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.38,0:25:51.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Is everyone okay?Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.10,0:25:54.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's go! The Sunny is waiting for us at the coast!Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.31,0:25:59.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait! They're going the wrong way.Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.82,0:26:05.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Rabiyan, go down again! Fly straight from the previous spot to the coastline!Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.48,0:26:06.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Roger!Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.87,0:26:10.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy-kun and everyone!Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.04,0:26:13.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait! You're going the wrong way! There's a wall ahead of you!Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.71,0:26:16.67,Main,,0,0,0,,What? Pudding? It's the nice Pudding!Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.67,0:26:19.37,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought we were going straight.Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.37,0:26:21.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course, we've been fooled.Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.55,0:26:23.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Everyone! The coastline is this way!Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.79,0:26:25.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's go!Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.59,0:26:28.23,Main,,0,0,0,,We won't let you leave!Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.56,0:26:32.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Leave them to me!Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.84,0:26:35.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Memories Fil:Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.45,0:26:45.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Flashback!Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.78,0:26:51.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, I need to go shopping.Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.12,0:26:55.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Brother hit me!Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.78,0:26:57.84,Main,,0,0,0,,I need to walk the dog.Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.84,0:27:01.64,Main,,0,0,0,,My son is missing. Has anyone seen him?Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.21,0:27:03.93,Main,,0,0,0,,What's going on?Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.93,0:27:06.85,Main,,0,0,0,,In any case, let's run before it's too late!Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.25,0:27:08.64,Main,,0,0,0,,What's going on?Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.64,0:27:10.39,Main,,0,0,0,,They're memories from the previous owners...Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.39,0:27:13.26,Main,,0,0,0,,of the souls that were used to create the Homies.Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.26,0:27:16.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Those memories are returning to them temporarily.Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.36,0:27:19.90,Main,,0,0,0,,While they're confused, Mama has no control over them.Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.90,0:27:23.28,Main,,0,0,0,,So Luffy-kun and the others can escape from the woods now.Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.28,0:27:25.99,Main,,0,0,0,,I see. Thank you, Pudding-chan!Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.41,0:27:33.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Why?! How long have you been there, Sanji...?Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.33,0:27:34.34,Main,,0,0,0,,-san!Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.34,0:27:36.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, just for a little bit.Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.02,0:27:37.40,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.40,0:27:39.43,Main,,0,0,0,,How did you not notice?!Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.43,0:27:42.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, Pudding-chan, let's rush to Chocolat Town.Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.80,0:27:45.22,Main,,0,0,0,,J-jump off and swim, you idiot!Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.79,0:27:48.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Your eye is beautiful even when you're mad...Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.26,0:27:54.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Pudding?Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.06,0:27:58.65,Main,,0,0,0,,I-I'm fine... D-D-Don't mess with me!Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.65,0:28:02.23,Main,,0,0,0,,O-Or I'll kill you, Sanji...Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.23,0:28:03.61,Main,,0,0,0,,-san!Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.13,0:28:07.94,Main,,0,0,0,,I see the coastline ahead!Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.94,0:28:09.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.10,0:28:13.90,Main,,0,0,0,,We made it! But... is Pudding really on our side now?!Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.90,0:28:19.03,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know! We shouldn't lower our guard until we escape their territory!Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.27,0:28:25.91,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't let you get away!Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.51,0:28:28.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Zeus!Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.50,0:28:30.88,Main,,0,0,0,,How could you do that?!Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.38,0:28:39.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Why did you get us involved?!Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.63,0:28:43.28,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry... I didn't mean for that to happen...Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.28,0:28:48.40,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't care what you meant to do! You better pay attention next time!Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.40,0:28:51.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, you're right...Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.15,0:28:56.11,Main,,0,0,0,,But they were so delicious... Those thundercloud eggs.Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.11,0:28:56.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?!Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.94,0:29:02.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you really listening to me?! Mama's orders are absolute!Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.49,0:29:04.58,Main,,0,0,0,,I know...Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.22,0:29:09.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Give it to me!Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.49,0:29:14.84,Main,,0,0,0,,My wedding cake!Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.84,0:29:15.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.59,0:29:19.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Dodge it!Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.66,0:29:27.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn...Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.46,0:29:30.47,Main,,0,0,0,,That was close!Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.47,0:29:32.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Jinbe!Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.02,0:29:55.28,Main,,0,0,0,,You're quite the match for our Chess Peacekeepers, skeleton...Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.83,0:29:58.81,Main,,0,0,0,,It's because I am...Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.81,0:30:01.37,Main,,0,0,0,,The Soul King!Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.37,0:30:05.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Enemies keep coming out of the mirror...Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.09,0:30:12.97,Main,,0,0,0,,They're coming from the mirror in Nami and Robin's room. Will they be mad if we break it?Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.97,0:30:16.81,Main,,0,0,0,,If we can break it, let's break it. We'll apologize later.Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.88,0:30:21.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Who are you gonna apologize to? Lick.Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.35,0:30:23.80,Main,,0,0,0,,You saw the lightning earlier, didn't you?Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.80,0:30:27.03,Main,,0,0,0,,None of them are returning to this ship.Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.49,0:30:34.79,Main,,0,0,0,,I've been saying that I want to show mercy on you two.Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.79,0:30:40.46,Main,,0,0,0,,No matter how hard you try, our soldiers will come through the mirror endlessly.Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.46,0:30:44.76,Main,,0,0,0,,And you guys will use up all of your energy eventually.Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.76,0:30:51.14,Main,,0,0,0,,If you submit right here, right now, I'll at least spare your life...Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.14,0:30:53.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Just give up already.Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.01,0:30:57.69,Main,,0,0,0,,What a foolish conversation.Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.65,0:31:03.01,Main,,0,0,0,,We're sick and tired of responding to that.Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.73,0:31:07.32,Main,,0,0,0,,We just want you to get off of our ship.Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.32,0:31:10.20,Main,,0,0,0,,The Sunny is our ship!Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.70,0:31:14.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you really wanna fight me?Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.26,0:31:30.10,Main,,0,0,0,,I see...Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.10,0:31:35.22,Main,,0,0,0,,It seems you don't really value your own life...Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.22,0:31:36.89,Main,,0,0,0,,All right.Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.89,0:31:40.11,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you with my own hands.Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.11,0:31:42.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Lick.Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.37,0:31:52.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh! That's the edge of the forest!Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.89,0:31:56.22,Main,,0,0,0,,All right! Let's go straight to Cacao Island!Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.36,0:32:04.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Brook! Chopper!Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.49,0:32:06.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Is that your ship?Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.66,0:32:09.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's getting attacked.Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.24,0:32:11.80,Main,,0,0,0,,I guess they were ambushed...Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.80,0:32:15.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Our older brothers are there!Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.95,0:32:20.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Our older brothers are attacking Sanji-san's friends...Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.75,0:32:22.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Hmph! Your friends are screwed!Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.88,0:32:27.01,Main,,0,0,0,,That'll teach ya! Those two are no match for our brothers!Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.01,0:32:31.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Your friends will be swallowed by the sea!Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.13,0:32:34.46,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you saying, Pudding?!Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.46,0:32:38.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! That's not what I meant to say!Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.56,0:32:43.05,Main,,0,0,0,,What do you wanna do? Should we go down to the ship?Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.23,0:32:47.73,Main,,0,0,0,,No, I'll come along with Pudding-chan.Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.73,0:32:48.77,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.11,0:32:53.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you sure? We'll keep on going then!Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.62,0:32:56.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we don't need to worry about them.Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.41,0:33:01.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Instead, let's get started...Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.87,0:33:07.71,Main,,0,0,0,,on the cake that will make Big Mom faint!Dialogue: 1,0:00:01.51,0:00:02.01,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 2,0:00:02.01,0:00:02.31,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:00:01.55,0:00:02.01,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 2,0:00:02.01,0:00:02.36,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:00:01.59,0:00:02.06,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,KiDialogue: 2,0:00:02.06,0:00:02.56,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,KiDialogue: 1,0:00:01.63,0:00:02.26,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,miDialogue: 2,0:00:02.26,0:00:02.95,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,miDialogue: 1,0:00:01.67,0:00:02.65,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,heDialogue: 2,0:00:02.65,0:00:03.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,heDialogue: 1,0:00:01.71,0:00:02.92,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,noDialogue: 2,0:00:02.92,0:00:03.44,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,noDialogue: 1,0:00:01.75,0:00:03.14,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,oDialogue: 2,0:00:03.14,0:00:03.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,oDialogue: 1,0:00:01.79,0:00:03.44,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,m